        "TileImage": "$($repository 30a6026f-d990-43fd-a6b9-586ca4db19a3).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. It seems that Crystal Dawn has caught on to what we&apos;re doing, and our client has been murdered. The terrorist group even locked down his neighborhood while they cleaned up the murder. You have three targets today. The first is Vivek Sabal, a high ranking member of Crystal Dawn and the man calling the shots around here. Your second target is Vival Sanjay, the man who killed our client. Your third target is Lakshmi Sachdev, the woman who ratted him out to Crystal Dawn.\rPart 3",
